 "What is Blok?": "index.html <span>",
 "Blok is a parental control app for iPhone. You lock selected apps on your child's iPhone remotely, from your own phone, in one tap. The lock can last until you unlock, for a set time, or follow schedules for school hours and bedtime.": "index.html <span>",
 "Apple's Screen Time enforces the lock, so it holds even if the app is closed or the phone restarts. Blok blocks apps; it doesn't monitor your child.": "index.html <span>",
