 "Tap LOCK": "index.html <span>",
 "Wherever you are. Unlock just as easily, or let a timed lock do it for you.": "index.html <span>",
 "Kids' screen time, on your terms": "index.html <span>",
 "Blok does one thing: gives your child a break from the phone when you decide.": "index.html <span>",
 "Timed locks": "index.html <span>",
 "30 minutes, one hour, two hours or until you unlock. You always see when it ends.": "index.html <span>",
 "School and bedtime schedules": "index.html <span>",
